\par\par \uc2 World News\par \uc2 World\par \b \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2  and President Biden to Meet as Both Face  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Tensions With U.S. Bishops; Clerics' debate over Communion for Catholic politicians who support  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  rights looms over Vatican visit\b0\par\par\uc2 By Francis X. Rocca \par \uc2 922 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 October 2021\par 09:30 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 ROME\u8212\'20\'14President Biden will meet \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2  on Friday for the first time during his administration, as both face contentious relationships with U.S. Catholic Church leaders {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/pope-francis-faces-tests-on-abortion-gay-rights-11632913201"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 over the issue of \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The Vatican visit by the second Catholic president in American history will come a little more than two weeks before U.S. bishops, meeting in Baltimore, are expected to debate whether Catholic politicians who support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, such as Mr. Biden, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/bishops-vote-to-prepare-document-on-communion-for-catholic-politicians-who-support-abortion-rights-11624041010"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 should be denied Communion }}}\uc2 . In June, 168 bishops out of 229 voted to draft a statement that would address the question, within a longer document on the importance of the Eucharist.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Biden regularly attends Mass in Delaware and Washington, D.C. Cardinal \uc2 Wilton Gregory\uc2  of Washington has said he wouldn't refuse the president Communion.\par \par \uc2 The Vatican has said that linking the reception of Communion to the politics of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be divisive. \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2  has taken a more conciliatory approach to Mr. Biden than have the leaders of the American episcopate.\par \par \uc2 Archbishop William Lori of Baltimore, a member of the committee that drafted the document on the Eucharist, said the pope's meeting with Mr. Biden would set an example for the bishops of dialogue with political leaders who differ with the church even on important issues.\par \par \uc2 But the archbishop said he saw Mr. Biden's Vatican visit "as in no way hampering us bishops in our role as teachers on the inestimable value of unborn human life."\par \par \uc2 Mr. Biden met \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2  three times while he was vice president, at the Vatican in 2013 and 2016 and during the pope's visit to the U.S. in 2015. He took Communion during the first Vatican visit.\par \par \uc2 The White House didn't provide additional details on the president's visit, including whether he would attend Mass or take Communion. Press secretary \uc2 Jen Psaki\uc2  has said the two would discuss the Covid-19 pandemic, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/cop26-glasgow-climate-change-summit-11611254971"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 climate change }}}\uc2  and poverty before the president attends the G-20 summit in Rome over the weekend.\par \par \uc2 Asked earlier this year about the possibility that the bishops would prevent him from receiving Communion, Mr. Biden said: "That's a private matter and I don't think that's going to happen."\par \par \uc2 Mr. Biden has cited the pope as a personal inspiration and placed a photograph of him behind his desk in the Oval Office. The pontiff, departing from custom, placed a congratulatory phone call to Mr. Biden after November's presidential election.\par \par \uc2 The president of the U.S. Conference of Catholic Bishops, Archbishop Jos\u233\'00\'E9 G\u243\'00\'F3mez of Los Angeles, said in a statement on Inauguration Day that Mr. Biden "has pledged to pursue certain policies that would advance moral evils and threaten human life and dignity, most seriously in the areas of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , contraception, marriage and gender."\par \par \uc2 In his own message to Mr. Biden the same day, \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2  didn't mention any of those issues.\par \par \uc2 The pope and president broadly agree on some important areas of policy, including migration and the environment. Mr. Biden's European itinerary following the Vatican will include {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/your-cheat-sheet-to-the-u-n-climate-change-conference-in-glasgow-11634690099"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the United Nations climate summit }}}\uc2 , COP26, in Glasgow. Earlier this month, \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2  played host to a meeting of faith leaders and scientists who issued a joint appeal to the COP26 participants for "urgent, radical and responsible action" against climate change.\par \par \uc2 SHARE YOUR THOUGHTS\par \par \uc2 Should Catholic politicians who support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights be able to receive Communion? Join the conversation below.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Biden supports legal access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, while the pope in recent weeks has forcefully restated the church's condemnation of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , describing it as murder and like hiring a hit man to solve a problem. He has also warned bishops not to politicize the reception of Communion.\par \par \uc2 The latest draft of the document that U.S. bishops will vote on at their mid-November meeting in Baltimore doesn't refer specifically to the eligibility of Catholic politicians to receive Communion or mention support for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights as a reason to be refused the sacrament, according to people who have read it. But bishops can still propose amendments to the document, even during the November meeting. At the debate in June, some bishops said it was urgent to clarify the church's teaching on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  under a Catholic president who supports \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 A spokeswoman for the U.S. Conference of Catholic Bishops declined to speculate on the bishops' discussions of the document.\par \par \uc2 "If the American bishops do endorse a harder-line position on access to the Eucharist for pro-choice Catholic politicians, that will be seen widely as an act of defiance of \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2 , and the fact that the pope will have met with President Biden just before that will add to that impression," said John Allen, head of the Catholic website Crux and author of several books on the Vatican.\par \par \uc2 Catherine Lucey in Washington contributed to this article.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  tensions\par \par \uc2 More WSJ coverage of the issue, in religion and politics, selected by the editors\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-agrees-to-quick-consideration-of-texas-abortion-case-leaves-state-law-in-place-for-now-11634921299"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Supreme Court Agrees to Quick Consideration of Texas \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Law }}}\uc2  (Oct. 22)\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/pope-francis-faces-tests-on-abortion-gay-rights-11632913201"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pope Francis Faces Tests on \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22 , Gay Rights }}}\uc2  (Sept. 29)\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/bishops-vote-to-prepare-document-on-communion-for-catholic-politicians-who-support-abortion-rights-11624041010"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bishops Advance Effort That Could Restrict Communion for Biden }}}\uc2  (June 18)\par \par \uc2 Write to Francis X. Rocca at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:francis.rocca@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 francis.rocca@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/pope-francis-and-president-biden-to-meet-as-both-face-abortion-tensions-with-u-s-bishops-11635327000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pope Francis and President Biden to Meet as Both Face \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Tensions With U.S. Bishops }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020211027ehar000xh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
