\par\par \uc2 Politics and Policy\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Justice Department to Ask Supreme Court to Block Texas  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Law; Biden administration's move presents high court with new occasion to consider the state's novel ban on women's abortions after six weeks\b0\par\par\uc2 By Brent Kendall \par \uc2 430 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 October 2021\par 18:03 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON\u8212\'20\'14The Justice Department on Friday said it would soon file a request with the Supreme Court seeking to block enforcement of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/texas-abortion-law-what-to-know-as-supreme-court-allows-it-to-take-effect-11630606238"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a Texas law that bans many abortions }}}\uc2  in the state.\par \par \uc2 The department's plans, announced by a spokesman, will pose a new test for the high court just weeks after the justices, on a 5-4 vote, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-rejects-emergency-request-to-block-texas-six-week-abortion-ban-11630556283"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 declined to prevent the law from taking effect }}}\uc2  in September.\par \par \uc2 The Justice Department has argued that its case against Texas offers an easier path for the Supreme Court to intervene than an earlier lawsuit filed by \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers against the state. Texas disagrees and has argued the federal government's lawsuit is improper.\par \par \uc2 The law, known as the Texas Heartbeat Act, or SB 8, says physicians can't knowingly perform an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  if there is "a detectable fetal heartbeat," which it defines as including cardiac activity in the embryo that appears after about six weeks into a pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 The law, which contains no exceptions for rape or incest, has proved difficult to challenge in court because state officials have no direct role in enforcing it. Instead, the law delegates enforcement to private parties and authorizes civil damages of $10,000 or more to anyone who successfully sues a defendant accused of performing or aiding in such an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 When \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights advocates were unable to win a court order blocking the law for now, the Justice Department stepped in with its own lawsuit.\par \par \uc2 On Oct. 6, a federal judge in Austin sided with DOJ and issued a preliminary injunction barring enforcement of SB 8, saying Texas had engaged in an unprecedented effort to deprive women of constitutionally protected \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights and keep its restrictions shielded from judicial review.\par \par \uc2 But on Thursday night, the Fifth U.S. Circuit Court of Appeals postponed the effect of that ruling and said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/texas-abortion-restrictions-can-continue-during-litigation-appeals-court-rules-11634261230"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Texas law could remain in place during ongoing litigation }}}\uc2  between Texas and the federal government. The appeals-court order could mean that the state \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions will remain in place for many months unless the Supreme Court intervenes.\par \par \uc2 Under Supreme Court precedent for almost 50 years, a woman has a constitutional right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the pre-viability months of pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 Write to Brent Kendall at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:brent.kendall@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 brent.kendall@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/justice-department-to-ask-supreme-court-to-block-texas-abortion-law-11634321002"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Justice Department to Ask Supreme Court to Block Texas \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Law }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020211015ehaf004h6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
