\par\par \uc2 Politics and Policy\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Biden to Meet With \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2  Ahead of G-20 Summit; The second Catholic U.S. president, Biden speaks often about his faith\b0\par\par\uc2 By Francis X. Rocca and Catherine Lucey \par \uc2 730 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 October 2021\par 15:16 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2  and President Biden will meet at the Vatican on Oct. 29 amid controversy among U.S. bishops over the second Catholic president's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/biden-to-reverse-abortion-rule-known-as-mexico-city-policy-11611835467"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 support for \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The White House announced the meeting, which was widely expected, on Thursday. It will take place during Mr. Biden's coming trip to Europe, where he will take part in a G-20 summit in Rome and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/cop26-host-britain-ramps-up-calls-for-emissions-plans-11634047609"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the United Nations climate summit, COP26 }}}\uc2 , in Glasgow. First lady Jill Biden will also participate.\par \par \uc2 The president and the pope will discuss ending {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/who-creates-new-team-to-study-pandemic-origins-11634156325"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Covid-19 pandemic }}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/some-climate-change-effects-may-be-irreversible-u-n-panel-report-says-11628496000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 climate change }}}\uc2  and caring for the poor, according to a White House statement. The Vatican didn't immediately respond to a request for comment.\par \par \uc2 This will be the first meeting of the two men since Mr. Biden's election last year. They previously met when then Vice President Biden {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/SB10001424127887323415304578369803458102408"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 attended the pope's inaugural Mass in 2013 }}}\uc2 , during the pope's 2015 visit to the U.S. and at a 2016 medical conference at the Vatican.\par \par \uc2 Their next meeting will come a little more than two weeks before U.S. Catholic bishops gather in Baltimore for their annual fall assembly, where they are expected to vote on a statement encouraging bishops to deny Communion to Catholic politicians, such as Mr. Biden, who support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Biden is a practicing Catholic who regularly attends Mass and receives Communion. Cardinal Wilton Gregory, who as archbishop of Washington is the president's pastor, has said that he would not refuse him Communion.\par \par \uc2 At their last meeting, in June, U.S. bishops voted by a large majority to proceed with drafting a statement on the matter, over the objections of \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2 ' strongest supporters in the U.S. episcopate. The Vatican's doctrinal office has warned that a statement linking Communion with the politics of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be divisive.\par \par \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2  has taken a more conciliatory approach than some other leaders to Mr. Biden and other Catholic politicians who support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 The pontiff departed from custom to make a congratulatory phone call to Mr. Biden shortly after the presidential election last November. On Inauguration Day in January, Archbishop Jos\u233\'00\'E9 G\u243\'00\'F3mez of Los Angeles, president of the U.S. Conference of Catholic Bishops, said that Mr. Biden "has pledged to pursue certain policies that would advance moral evils and threaten human life and dignity, most seriously in the areas of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , contraception, marriage and gender." \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2 ' message to Mr. Biden the same day didn't mention any of those issues.\par \par \uc2 Asked about the controversy over Communion at a news conference last month, \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2  emphasized the Catholic Church's teaching that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is homicide but, without addressing the U.S. situation specifically, cautioned bishops not to politicize the reception of Communion.\par \par \uc2 Earlier in the summer, when asked at a White House event about the possibility that the bishops would prevent him from receiving Communion, Mr. Biden said: "That's a private matter and I don't think that's going to happen."\par \par \uc2 While they differ on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2  and Mr. Biden are closer on other issues, including immigration and the environment. The pope has said that COP26 "represents an urgent summons to provide effective responses to the unprecedented ecological crisis and the crisis of values that we are presently experiencing."\par \par \uc2 Earlier this month, the pope met with House Speaker \uc2 Nancy Pelosi\uc2  (D., Calif.), who was in Rome for meetings of legislators in preparation for the G-20 and COP26.\par \par \uc2 Archbishop Salvatore Cordileone of San Francisco has criticized Mrs. Pelosi, a Catholic whose home district is in his archdiocese, for her support of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. The archbishop has called on Catholics to fast and pray for Mrs. Pelosi to change her position on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Also this month, Mr. Biden nominated former Sen. Joseph Donnelly (D., Ind.), a Catholic, as U.S. ambassador to the Holy See. As a senator, Mr. Donnelly opposed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, with exceptions in cases of rape, incest and danger to the life of the mother.\par \par \uc2 Write to Francis X. Rocca at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:francis.rocca@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 francis.rocca@wsj.com }}}\uc2  and Catherine Lucey at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:catherine.lucey@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 catherine.lucey@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/biden-to-meet-with-pope-francis-ahead-of-g-20-summit-11634222170"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Biden to Meet With Pope Francis Ahead of G-20 Summit  }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020211014ehae003ml\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
