\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 Supreme Court's New Term Tackles Guns,  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2 , Religious Expression; High court meets for in-person arguments with masks, Justice Amy Coney Barrett and a docket of divisive issues\b0\par\par\uc2 By Jess Bravin and Brent Kendall \par \uc2 1,015 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 October 2021\par 22:42 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON\u8212\'20\'14The Supreme Court returns to its courtroom Monday for its first in-person arguments since March 2020, opening a term featuring challenges to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, gun regulations and a secular public-school system.\par \par \uc2 The term will be the first with Justice Amy Coney Barrett present in the seat once held by Justice \uc2 Ruth Bader Ginsburg\uc2 . Her death in September 2020 opened the door for Republicans, then controlling the Senate appointment process, to solidify the court's conservative majority.\par \par \uc2 Justice Barrett kept a relatively low profile during her first term on the bench, when the court, working remotely, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/justice-barrett-showed-her-conservative-stripes-but-defied-expectations-11625316673"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 found common ground on several notable rulings. }}}\uc2  Those included a 7-2 decision that rejected another major challenge to the Affordable Care Act.\par \par \uc2 Justice Barrett's record as a law professor and appellate judge and the coming docket portend a distinct turn for the court on some of the most divisive issues.\par \par \uc2 Following her elevation, the court agreed to hear appeals that explicitly call for overruling Roe v. Wade, the 1973 decision that women had a constitutional right to end pregnancy in some circumstances, or striking down century-old laws that restrict the carrying of concealed weapons.\par \par \uc2 Previously, the court routinely declined appeals proposing to eliminate \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights or widen access to firearms, suggesting there weren't five justices ready to consider such moves.\par \par \uc2 The gun case, challenging a New York state law limiting concealed weapons permits to those with "proper cause," is slated for November and could see the court expand Second Amendment rights to allow handguns in public. In 2008 and 2010 decisions, the court recognized a constitutional right to keep a handgun at home for self-defense.\par \par \uc2 In December, Mississippi will argue to reinstate its law banning abortions after 15 weeks, which lower courts struck down under Supreme Court precedents that allow women to end pregnancies before fetal viability, or the ability to live outside the womb. Mississippi argues that the simplest solution would be striking down the precedents its law was found to violate.\par \par \uc2 In September, the court declined to block an even more restrictive Texas \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law, on a 5-4 vote, with Justices Barrett and \uc2 Brett Kavanaugh\uc2  part of a conservative majority that cited procedural reasons for the court not intervening. Chief Justice \uc2 John Roberts\uc2  found himself in dissent along with the three liberal justices, a lineup that suggested {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/texas-ruling-raises-doubts-about-chief-justices-hold-on-the-roberts-court-11630624331"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 his ability to moderate the court's actions }}}\uc2  since Justice Barrett replaced Justice Ginsburg is eroding.\par \par \uc2 The diminishing liberal presence on the court has placed a spotlight on 83-year-old Justice \uc2 Stephen Breyer\uc2 . The \uc2 Bill Clinton\uc2  appointee has been facing pressure from the left to step down, while Democrats maintain a razor-thin Senate majority that could confirm a like-minded successor. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich426\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6390
