\par\par \uc2 Review & Outlook (U.S.)\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 The Justices Take Up  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2 ; The result in the Mississippi case is hard to predict.\b0\par\par\uc2 By The Editorial Board \par \uc2 511 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 May 2021\par 22:28 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 So much for ducking the hard cases. Not long after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/gun-rights-return-to-the-supreme-court-11619468152"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 taking up}}}\uc2  a contentious New York gun-rights case, the Supreme Court on Monday agreed to hear what could become a landmark case on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 Dobbs v. Jackson Women's Health Organization concerns Mississippi's 2018 law that, with rare exceptions, barred \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after 15 weeks of pregnancy. Lower courts overturned the law as a violation of the Supreme Court's precedents, notably the 1992 Planned Parenthood v. Casey ruling that said state laws cannot impose an "undue burden" on the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The question is whether the current Court, bolstered by new Justices Amy Coney Barrett and \uc2 Brett Kavanaugh\uc2 , is ready to narrow Casey or even overturn it and Roe v. Wade. The left is already predicting the latter, in apocalyptic terms, but it always does.\par \par \uc2 This is hardly a foregone result. It makes sense that the Court wouldn't take the case merely to affirm the lower courts. But then only four Justices are needed to take up a case, and no one outside the Court knows which Justices voted to take this one. Those four Justices may not even know if there's a majority to uphold the Mississippi law, much less overturn Casey and Roe. Among the current Justices, only \uc2 Clarence Thomas\uc2  is on record as calling for Roe and Casey to be overturned.\par \par \uc2 The Court intrigue is compounded by the narrow question its order in the case said the Justices will address: whether all pre-viability bans on elective abortions violate the Constitution. This suggests the Court could uphold the Mississippi statute while narrowing Casey but not overturning it. Or the Court could say some bans on pre-viability abortions are legal, but that Mississippi's goes too far by limiting them to 15 weeks. Viability is usually thought to be no earlier than 23-24 weeks.\par \par \uc2 Even if the Mississippi law is upheld, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights wouldn't disappear. \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  would remain legal for 15 weeks, nearly four months, and no more than a few other states would have the votes to go as far as Mississippi.\par \par \uc2 Even if the Court overturned Roe and Casey, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights wouldn't vanish. Nearly all states would quickly pass laws legalizing it, albeit sometimes with more restrictions than current law allows. Republicans might suffer politically in some states until the debate sorts itself out, but then that's the way democratic politics is supposed to work.\par \par \uc2 The Court finds itself in this thicket because it usurped the laws of all 50 states with Roe in 1973. \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  politics has roiled the country and the Court ever since, and the public lobbying and threats before the Justices hear the case next fall will be fierce. Vows of Court-packing are sure to return. We hope the Justices ignore the politics and follow the Constitution, which is what they take an oath to do.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/the-justices-take-up-abortion-11621376923"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Justices Take Up \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020210518eh5i005h9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
